       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum of 3,200 mg/day. A single 1600 mg dose is also double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg. At this dose the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events rise substantially, even in a patient with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum for anti-inflammatory dosing)\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth every 6 hours** (typical for analgesia)\n- **1600 mg per day in divided doses**, for example 400 mg four times daily\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me the clinical rationale and I'll add it as a note. Please also confirm the dose, because it's well outside the labeled range. Otherwise, tell me which dose to enter and I'll place the order."
